<p>You requested a password reset for your JobFlow account.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Reset your JobFlow password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></p>

<p>This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.</p>

<p>If you did not request this, you can ignore this email. Your password will stay the same.</p>
